  <book code="2TI" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:32:49 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Ti-mô-thê đu bơơr</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Ti-mô-thê</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Phaau-lô, sưưq-đô ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, ting paraaq hươq leq parmông kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />pagơơi leq Ti-mô-thê, akóón nh'nhơr bơk ưng aku: Rââm akóón bâân ơơn phươk liêm, rau kayô ka-er lơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng nek Ama lơq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Aku tapôông paraaq ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, Yaang aku têêng yaauq klóóih patet tââq nôôq klaang akonh abhươp, palơq luônh lóóm chadhah sek, xók hayum tangêi aku kah katơng hei tơk akóón kalóóng nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng ađêi, <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />đương rââm lum akóón, hei tơk đơơk mat akóón, buôn aku bâân bing bhlaai lóóm bhuui, <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />taai ve rau pató pahei leq lóóm huuiq lalua dhalam kalóóng akóón, nek lóóm huuiq bhêêl tarnââp tơơt kalóóng Lô-iit, amooq nguôi akóón, hayơq Ơ-niit, amêêq akóón, aku huuiq kơi lóóm huuiq achêk kung dyơq tơơt kalóóng akóón.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Hơq ơi taai kơi ađek, aku pahei akóón phaai padyunh lóóiq ơơn ưng Yaang Pleng nek ơơn tơơt kalóóng akóón tââq rau kadhâng têi ưng aku. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Taai Yaang Pleng ơi kah đóng leq nôôq he lóóm kanóq ưng rau dyââng katui, hơq nek ưng praan karơ, ưng lóóm tanhơr lơq rau pakala. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Kơi achêk hơq, akóón óóq kachiit mat leq tarnêêng truuih đuui đóng Chuôq nôôq he, kung óóq kachiit mat leq aku, đu tơơt đong kanam ưng Ađó. Klóóih dhiq ađek, phaai ting đơơp jarnah taai Taruuih Liêm, ve mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Yaang ơi paq nôôq he lơq tađaang dhaloong nôôq he palơq rau tađaang dhaloong liêm, eh rau ting tarnêêng têêng ưng nôôq he, bơơi ting kanóq kaniêng n'tua ưng Ađó, lơq ting ơơn phươk liêm, nek rau ơi bâân đóng leq nôôq he kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq n'loom đươnh điêq kah bil, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />hơq xók ađôk ơi bâân tapakah tââq rau tabhral ưng Chuôq Paq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, xók ơi têêng đóng akan chêt, val xar kah atiêng hơq bat brương parmông palơq rau kah bil dhiq Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />taai Taruuih Liêm ađek hơq aku ơi bâân chaleq yua nek manưih truuih pachóóm, sưưq-đô, lơq manưih pachóóm, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />kung ơi taai ađek hơq aku đơơp xâng hadhơơp nhok palơq nôôq rau ađô. Bơơi aku yươq kachiit mat taai aku n'nal Yaang ađêi huuiq lơq aku kanóq dhakơi kơi ađô Ađó ve mataai jư lêi rau pajaau đóng ưng aku tơk leq tangêi ađek.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Akóón phaai pei jư par loom leq paraaq pachóóm liêm kre đu akóón ơi xâng tââq aku, palơq lóóm huuiq lơq lóóm tanhơr kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Phaai đương jư rau đóng pajaau kre liêm ve Chuôq Yaang Liêm, nek Yaang mamông kalóóng nôôq he.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Akóón n'nal rau ađô, ađek nek tabhơt nôôq manưih dhiq A-si ơi kah đươi aku, hơq kalóóng ađek ve Phi-geen lơq Heet-mô-geen.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Nhan Chuôq đóng ơơn kayô ka-er đóng đong Ô-nê-si-phô-rơ, taai ađó biêh taluôn bhơơl pahêêl aku lơq yươq kachiit mat leq taklooiq kađaai ưng aku. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Palâh lóóiq, xók tơơt dhiq Rô-ma, ađó ơi bhơt lóóm tho tamóh leq aku lơq ơi bâân talum. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Nhan Chuôq đóng ơơn leq amei buôn bâân talum rau kayô ka-er tư tââq Ađó kalóóng tangêi ađek. Dyơq akóón n'nal drêh ađó achêk ơi têêng yaauq bơk ng'kơi dhiq Ê-phê-sô.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Kơi achêk hơq, akóón aku ơơi, akóón phaai đóng ađêi bâân grâ karơ kalóóng ơơn phươk liêm dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Nôôq dhơơm akóón ơi xâng tư tââq aku m'pơng bơk manưih truuih, phaai pajaau đóng piđó leq nôôq manưih chóóm huuiq ganơơm hơq piđó kung e ve chóóm đuôh buôn pató pachóóm manưih lââng. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Phaai kung đơơp jarnah xangaat palơq aku, kơi mưi manưih linh kataai ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Xók têêng manưih linh óóq ngaai đóng ađêi bâân kamak vơng nôôq tarnêêng ưng rau mamông dhanuôr manưih, hơq đóng manưih linh achêk ve chóóm têêng bhuui lóóm manưih ơi chââih dhaloong ađêi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Kung kơi achêk, xók ngaai ađek ting tapâng tarjeng kataai, manưih achêk e kah bâân panơơng pô đươk lơh la kah pađuôh tarjeng ting gani. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Manưih têêng hare jêi tarang phaai bâân đơơp chanoh chabet laloom tââm. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Phaai kanóq val vôôiq rau aku dyơq praaq, taai Chuôq e đóng leq akóón rau chóóm n'nal kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Phaai hei tơk Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, ơi bâân payuur mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, mađó dhong nooi Đa-viit, ting kơi Taruuih Liêm ưng aku, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />taai Taruuih Liêm ađek, aku đơơp jarnah tơk mơ taklooiq taglóóng kơi mưi manưih matu lơt. Dhơ kơi ađek, paraaq Yaang Pleng nek yươq bâân taklooiq tachoq mơ. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Taai kơi achêk, aku đơơp jruôn dyóp rau taai nôôq manưih bâân lưa chââih, buôn piđó kung ve chóóm bâân rau paq jóói kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek palơq cha-iil tabah nh'chró.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Paraaq ađô nek đaang huuiq ganơơm:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Taai la nôôq he ơi chêt palơq Ađó, nek nôôq he kung e mamông palơq Ađó.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />La nôôq he đuôh đơơp jruôn, nek nôôq he kung e ting kadhâng akoq palơq Ađó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">La nôôq he dyiin Ađó, nek Ađó kung e dyiin nôôq he.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />La nôôq he kah bhơt lóóm, nek Ađó biêh bhiêk yươq tadhơ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">taai Ađó kah chóóm tư dyiin ađêi.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Phaai pató pahei manưih huuiq Chuôq nôôq rau achêk, xók trêh móón piđó toom mat Yaang Pleng buôn óóq tarjeng tarkaai leq chư dhanóók, taai kah rau malơơi malaai, chapiên đââng tơk rau hư bil nek palơq manưih xâng. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Phaai têêng bhơt praan đóng gluh pakah chênh akóón kala kơi manưih pâng dhalam toom Yaang Pleng, mưi chanak têêng makông yươq kachiit mat, truuih pachóóm kre pâng paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Mat lââng, phaai róch nôôq dharơp tapraaq taxêi dhiq đơơi kah machak maraang, taai piđó e đââng tơk dhiq kah bhi chap kaang lơh, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />lơq paraaq tapraaq taxêi ưng nôôq manưih achêk e vaaih xar rau trââi tơơr thê kơi matóch pa bhachơh, hơq kalóóng nôôq ađek nek Hi-mê-nê lơq Phi-lêêt, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />nôôq đu ơi vôôiq lơt xraang palơq paraaq dhalam, xók praaq kơi ađô rau mamông lóóiq xong ơi yuur vaaih, lơq piđó dyơq têêng pahư lóóm huuiq ưng mưi phơn manưih. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Dhơ kơi ađek, bhanơn pariiq mưng liêm ưng Yaang Pleng ơi dyương mưng, xók ve paraaq kanal ađô: “Chuôq n'nal ngaai nôôq mađó lơq Ađó” lơq “Dhơ dhangaai dhaloong gavơh dhanóók Chuôq phaai róch changaai tââq rau kah liêm.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mat lââng, kalóóng mưi dhanong đong gamak, kah chapiên ve angóók palơq vaang lơq baak, hơq dyơq palơq n'lóóng lơq katiêk tet, mưi phơn koom leq tarnêêng kiiq liêm, hơq phơn lââng koom leq tarnêêng havaar kaxu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Kơi achêk hơq, la ngaai ơi kajut pasek ađêi tââq nôôq rau achêk, nek manưih ađek e nek m'beq angóók koom leq tarnêêng kiiq liêm, ơi bâân lơơi pantua, malơơi đóng palơq kala, bâân ravang koom đóng dyóp rau tarnêêng liêm.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Phaai mut klôôn nôôq lóóm malóóch kiêng ưng tuôi paniên, hơq ting viêng rau bhơt liêm, lóóm huuiq, lóóm tanhơr, palơq rau liêm marleng palơq nôôq manưih dhaloong gavơh Chuôq palơq kalóóng lóóm sek chadhah. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Bơơi nek óóq tapâng nôôq tarkaai pađươk ngôôk ngaak lơq kah n'nal bhluuch, taai n'nal kơi piđó chapiên yuur vaaih tarkaai tarlak. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Manưih dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq phaai óóq tarkaai tarlak, bơơi phaai moor charnap palơq dyóp ngaai, ve đuôh pató pachóóm, jruôn parngau, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />xók chaleq kayua nôôq đu jaklâk jơl ađêi palơq rau moor dha-iiq, ngaai n'nal Yaang Pleng đóng leq piđó lóóm klôôq matu malóóm tơk rau kanóq n'nal paraaq dhalam, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />lơq piđó ve chóóm meh lóóiq tââq dham biêng ưng abhưi abhóch, xong xók bâân ađó kóóp jư buôn têêng ting karnóq ađó.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Bơơi akóón phaai n'nal rau ađô, ađek nek kalóóng nôôq tangêi tatun xariêq, e vaaih tơk nôôq ganah bhêêl kadhaap kara. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Taai akóón manưih e nh'nhơr ađêi, nh'nhơr jêên baak, laach jơơr, praaq harlaau, praaq chôlô, kah xâng bóóp akonh akan, kah n'nal ơơn, mamông kah liêm, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />kah mót lóóm, kah chóóm mamông paliêm, buôn praaq tamôôp, kah jư ađêi, vaaih lóóm grô jar-ââih, kah nh'nhơr rau đu liêm, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />tabil ơơn, huông jarul, i-thi têêng ađêi, nh'nhơr đu bhuui lơh nh'nhơr Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />ve têêng pathê huuiq bhi, bơơi vil m'peq lơơi mataai karơ ưng rau huuiq bhi. Phaai viêr changaai nôôq manưih achêk.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Taai kalóóng m'pơng piđó nek nôôq đu tông mót đong palââng, yua pa-eep nôôq pađiil parkan ngôôk ngaak, ng'gơơn tabing matu lơt, bâân đââng dharơơl tââq dyóp rau malóóch kiêng, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />đuui taluôn hơq kah mơ ve chóóm vôôiq tơk dhiq kanóq n'nal paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Jaan-neet lơq Jaam-be ơi jaklâk jơl Môôi-se ng'kơi, nek nôôq manưih ađô kung dyơq jaklâk jơl paraaq dhalam kơi achêk, kabhuh manưih achêk nek nôôq manưih ve lóóm karnóq bâân hư bil, nek nôôq đu galơơk pathê nek palơq lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Bơơi piđó e kah ruul kuôq changaai đuôh, taai rau ngôôk ngaak ưng piđó e val kơi drêh dróói toom mat dyóp ngaai, kung thê kơi rau ngôôk ngaak ưng bơơr chanak tôôh ơi haleh gluh.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Bơơi akóón ơi ting griêq paraaq pachóóm, kơi mamông, kanóq kaniêng, lóóm huuiq, lóóm jruôn parngau, lóóm tanhơr, rau đuôh jruôn ưng aku, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />nôôq galuh kóóp róp, nôôq jarnah xarngaat kơi ơi vaaih tơk leq aku dhiq An-ti-ôôt, dhiq I-kô-ni, dhiq Liit-trơ, dyóp kơi kóóp róp hơq aku ơi đơơp. Lơq Chuôq ơi jóói paq aku tââq tabhơt piđó. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Bơơi alua tabhơt ngaai nôôq kiêng mamông kơi huuiq bhi kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih maar e bâân têêng jarnah. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Hayơq kabhuh manưih lơt aak lơq đu bhlơp chachââr e kaang yuur vaaih rau mahaai mahư bơk lơh, galơơk chachââr palââng lơq bâân palââng galơơk chachââr. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, akóón, phaai bhiêk tơơt kalóóng nôôq rau đu akóón ơi đuui lơq huuiq mưng, taai n'nal ađêi ơi đuui piđó tư tââq ngaai, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />lơq kơi tââq bhêêl dyơq paniên, akóón ơi hok n'nal Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, ve chóóm têêng akóón tabech galang malóóm tơk rau paq jóói taai lóóm huuiq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="2TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Bhơt Bha-aar Yaang Pleng nek rau gahó parhââm ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq nek rau malơơi đóng tarnêêng pató pachóóm, trêh teng, klôôq paliêm pajêi pakeen kalóóng rau bhơt liêm, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />buôn manưih ưng Yaang Pleng ve chóóm hayơq bhơt dyóp, bâân ravang pasam bing dyóp, đóng dyóp rau tarnêêng liêm.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Aku taniih charnap truuih pachóóm akóón toom mat Yaang Pleng lơq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Yaang e xêi xanêi manưih mamông lơq manưih chêt, taai rau bhral tơk ưng Ađó lơq katiêk Ađó, kơi ađô: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Phaai truuih pachóóm Paraaq Chuôq; phaai ravang ravưa, dhơ kalóóng ganah khe môôiq ganah kadhaap; phaai trêh padheep, jươm teng, mââl bhơơl, palơq tabhơt rau jruôn parngau lơq praaq parchóóm. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Taai e tơk ganah xók palââng e kah đuôh xâng paraaq parchóóm liêm kre. Klóóih dhiq ađek, piđó e panjoop đóng ađêi nôôq manưih pachóóm ting malóóch kiêng n'tua ưng ađêi, đóng hangur bóng katór, <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />hayơq e kah mơ palơh katór gluh tââq paraaq dhalam, hơq dyơq palâh leq nôôq chiên huông hư. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Bơơi akóón, phaai bhriêl tabech kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng. Phaai đơơp jruôn jarnah xarngaat. Phaai têêng tarnêêng ưng manưih truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm. Phaai chachên tarnêêng têêng ưng akóón.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Dyơq aku nek dyơq bâân tantoh kơi mưi bhanuôih aq, lơq tơk bhêêl yuur vôôiq ưng aku ơi griêq đan. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Aku ơi tarjeng tarjơl kalóóng mưi galuh pađuôh pađươk liêm kre; aku ơi xong bhơt kalơng pađuôh; aku ơi jư tamưng lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Xók đôk, panơơng bhơt liêm ơi pakoom lơơi đóng aku, nek panơơng đu Chuôq, Manưih Praaq Xêi bhơt liêm, e đóng chaner leq aku kalóóng tangêi ađek, hơq kah chapiên pakoom đóng aku, bơơi dyơq đóng tabhơt nôôq manưih nh'nhơr rau bhral tơk ưng Ađó.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Phaai tabhlơng tabhơt praan đóng đâh tơk lum aku, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Taai Đê-ma ơi lơơi aku, taai malóóch kiêng đơơi ađôk, lơq ađó ơi vôôiq tơk Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka. Kơ-rêêt-xeen vôôiq Ga-la-ti, Tiit vôôiq Đa-ma-ti. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Chapiên dyơq Lu-ka tơơt palơq aku. Xong xók pơh Maak, phaai đââng ađó achêk ting palơq akóón ơi taai ađó achêk chóóm malơơi đóng aku kalóóng tarnêêng têêng. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Aku ơi kayua Ti-chi-kơ tơk Ê-phê-sô. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Xók vôôiq, akóón, phaai đââng ting m'beq aau chaguôk đu aku lơơi dhiq đong Ka-buut dhiq kanóón Trô-et, nek palơq nôôq panuôl bha-aar, đu tââm nek nôôq panuôl bha-aar ng'kar.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Têi manưih tôk kóng A-lek-xan-đơ ơi têêng mahaai aku bơk bhlơng. Chuôq e chróót charóót ađó ting kơi nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađó, <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />nek manưih đu akóón kung phaai hêch lêi, taai ađó, tabhlơng jaklâk jơl paraaq pachóóm ưng nôôq he.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Xók bhêêl ââi paq tarnââp ưng aku, kah ngaai tơk pakah mat palơq aku, bơơi tabhơt maar xooq lơơi aku. Nhan matu ađek yươq n'toh lóóiq dhiq piđó. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Bơơi Chuôq ơi dyương hót aku lơq têêng đóng aku karơ gamak, buôn tââq aku, tarnêêng truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm bâân yuur têêng bhơt dyóp, lơq tabhơt dhanuôr lââng maar ve chóóm bâân xâng. Aku kung ơi bâân paq jóói tââq bóóp sư tư. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Chuôq e trôông paq aku tââq dyóp tarnêêng aak lơq e jư havit aku leq katiêk pleng ưng Ađó. Nhan cha-iil tabah chô leq Ađó đóng tơk nh'chró, kah bil. A-meen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Phaai tamóh tham Bê-rit-siin lơq A-kui-la, palơq dhanong đong Ô-nê-si-phô-rơ. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Ê-raat tơơt lóóiq dhiq Kô-riin-tô, dyơq Trô-phiim taai ka-ai hơq aku lơơi lóóiq dhiq Mi-lê. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Phaai tabhlơng tabhơt praan tơk loom nil ha-ót. Ơ-bu-lu, palơq Bu-đeen, Li-nuut, Kơ-lau-đia, lơq nôôq adhi anó maar tamóh tham akóón.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Gavơh Chuôq tơơt palơq lóóm karnóq akóón. Nhan ơơn phươk liêm tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>